				<tr class="titlebg2">
						<td class="middletext">
								<div style="float: left; width: 3ex;">&nbsp;1&nbsp;</div>
								<div style="float: left;">&nbsp;<a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php#2">An Audience With Stormwatch</a> / <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?board=2.0">The Council Chamber</a> / <b><a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?topic=1830.msg19337#msg19337">Re: Apply for Stormwatch membership</a></b></div>
								<div align="right">&nbsp;on: June 03, 2006, 11:28:46 am&nbsp;</div>
						</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
						<td class="catbg" colspan="3">
							<span class="middletext"> Started by <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=4">Ziel</a> - Last post by <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=141">Squallhart</a> </span>
						</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
						<td class="windowbg2" colspan="3" valign="top" height="80">
								<div class="post">Hello There!<br /><br />Thank you for the oppurtunity to apply to your guild.<br /><br />First lets get the specifics out of the way, and then I will tell you more about myself!<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Character:&nbsp; Squallhart. Level 60 Mage.&nbsp; I am a Frost/Arcane spec 33/18.&nbsp; For more information on my spec please see the following link.<br /><br /><a href="http://www.worldofwarcraft.com/info/classes/mages/talents.html?0050505102000000000000000000005050201320501351" target="_blank">http://www.worldofwarcraft.com/info/classes/mages/talents.html?0050505102000000000000000000005050201320501351</a><br /><br />2.&nbsp; Guild History:&nbsp; I have been in two guilds previously.&nbsp; The first being Angels of Wrath, a purely RP guild.&nbsp; The reason I left was because I found myself less interested in RP as much as raiding.&nbsp; I enjoy RP&#039;ing part time and in the &quot;say&quot; channel, however I prefer to do it casually on my own time.&nbsp; However I love the members of the Angels of Wrath, and speek to them frequently.&nbsp; <br /><br />The second gulid I was in was Stormseekers.&nbsp; I left the guild after taking a 2 month break from the game.&nbsp; I decided to pursue another guild as their raiding times clash with my schedule.&nbsp; It was also very easy to abuse their loot system.&nbsp; Therefore, many players would come and go once they had the gear that they wanted.&nbsp; Again, nothing against the Stormseekers, as I still talk to many members today.<br /><br />3.&nbsp; I am not currently guilded.<br /><br />4.&nbsp; Raiding Experience:&nbsp; I have experience raiding MC all the way to Ragnoras.&nbsp; I have experience raiding ZG as well, however, I have probably only been halfway through it.&nbsp; I am a very good learner, and a very good listener, so I feel that I will be able to learn the instances very quickly.&nbsp; <br /><br />5.&nbsp; Past MMORPG:&nbsp; I played Final Fantasy 11 for a few months.&nbsp; I simply was not impressed with the game and quit.&nbsp; I have been playing World of Warcraft since the release date, and I have always played a mage.<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />Well here is the fun part!&nbsp; In real life, I am a 23 year old man, who works a shift from 9am-5pm in Computed Tomography.&nbsp; I am working on becoming certified in CT and MRI, so I do spend time studying.&nbsp; I also live in Arizona, so raiding times are PERFECT for me.<br /><br />I am also a musician, and I am currently saving money to build up a personal studio to make some phat tunes with :-).<br /><br />The reason I bring these points up is because I want people to know that I do have a real life, and it does come first!&nbsp; However, I am what I consider a player who likes to play hard, but not hardcore.&nbsp; I feel that this guild would be perfect for me, so I could get my gaming fix in, and then pursue my other loves on Friday-Sunday!&nbsp; I am also in a relationship right now, and it would be perfect to have those times to spend with my loved ones.<br /><br />I also realize that my age may turn some people off, however I am known to be somewhat of an old soul.&nbsp; I do not get offended easily, I do not seek drama, I do like to have fun and joke, but not in an immature fashion (ie: racial slurs, hateful remarks, etc)!&nbsp; I think I would have a lot in common with people in the guild as I can be friends with anybody from 12-60 and I have proof of that in my real life!&nbsp; <br /><br />My goals if joining this guild would be as follows;<br /><br />1 =&nbsp; Get nice loot.&nbsp; Lets be honest here, we raid to get loot!&nbsp; However I do firmly beleive that I play to have fun as well, and would hope to join a fun environment within the guild.<br /><br />2 = Help others.&nbsp; I am serious when I say this.&nbsp; I do help others sometimes more than I should.&nbsp; I prefer to have scheduled raid times, and then help others get what they need on off times.&nbsp; I hope to get the same things from others in the guild!&nbsp; I think it is imperative to work together to get what we all need to complete our missions.<br /><br />3 = Have fun.&nbsp; I like to play hard, but I also like to have fun while I&#039;m playing, so I would hope that this guild is condusive to that enviroment!<br /><br />Thank you so much for taking time to read my application.&nbsp; I hope to hear from somebody in game soon!</div>
						</td>
				</tr>
