								<div style="float: left; width: 3ex;">&nbsp;2&nbsp;</div>
								<div style="float: left;">&nbsp;<a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php#2">An Audience With Stormwatch</a> / <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?board=2.0">The Council Chamber</a> / <b><a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?topic=2860.msg19336#msg19336">Re: Greetings from Truth and Honor</a></b></div>
								<div align="right">&nbsp;on: June 03, 2006, 09:04:01 am&nbsp;</div>
						</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
						<td class="catbg" colspan="3">
							<span class="middletext"> Started by <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=140">Zeet</a> - Last post by <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=4">Ziel</a> </span>
						</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
						<td class="windowbg2" colspan="3" valign="top" height="80">
								<div class="post">Greetings,<br /><br />Stormwatch is not looking for raid guests, fillers or alliances. Sorry if you misunderstood our message in the Guild Recruitment channel; we are currently recruiting one hunter and one mage (see <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?topic=1830.0" target="_blank">http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?topic=1830.0</a>) .<br /><br />Best of luck in your search for an open raiding group.</div>
						</td>
				</tr>
			</table>
			<br />
		<table width="100%" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="1" border="0" class="bordercolor">
				<tr class="titlebg2">
						<td class="middletext">
								<div style="float: left; width: 3ex;">&nbsp;3&nbsp;</div>
								<div style="float: left;">&nbsp;<a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php#2">An Audience With Stormwatch</a> / <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?board=2.0">The Council Chamber</a> / <b><a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?topic=2860.msg19333#msg19333">Greetings from Truth and Honor</a></b></div>
								<div align="right">&nbsp;on: June 02, 2006, 11:58:17 pm&nbsp;</div>
						</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
						<td class="catbg" colspan="3">
							<span class="middletext"> Started by <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=140">Zeet</a> - Last post by <a href="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=140">Zeet</a> </span>
						</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
						<td class="windowbg2" colspan="3" valign="top" height="80">
								<div class="post">Hello Stormwatch.&nbsp; I am Zeet, Co-GM of Truth and Honor.&nbsp; We saw a message in chat that said to come here to check on being able to get into your raids.<br /><br />I myself am a 60 Warrior 403 def 4988 HP<br /><br />My girlfirend and also GM of Truth and Honor is named Sherrylann 60 Druid.&nbsp; <br /><br />We both have Experience in MC/Ony/ZG and myself limited AQ and BWL experience.&nbsp; We are looking to become part of a regular raid without having to turn our guild over to someone else.&nbsp; If interested please send us a tell in game or I will check this post from time to time to see if there is anything new.<br /><br />Regards,<br />Zeet Co-GM<br />Truth and Honor</div>
						</td>
				</tr>
			</table>
